        <mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;What a requester can do&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Create items, see only their own, read the catalog lists. After ER-01 locks a request they can no longer edit it. No Entra rights needed.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#605E5C;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;" vertex="1" parent="1">
